- content_for :title, "About — Sew Twirly"
- content_for :description, "Learn about Sew Twirly, a creative community for makers who love to sew and share."

.max-w-2xl.mx-auto.py-8
  h1.text-3xl.font-bold.text-gray-900.mb-4 About Sew Twirly

  p.text-lg.text-gray-700.mb-8
    | Sew Twirly is a creative community for makers who love to sew and share. Browse handmade sewing projects with shoppable product links — from initial inspiration to finished project.

  .space-y-8
    div
      h2.text-xl.font-semibold.text-gray-900.mb-3 For Creators
      p.text-gray-700
        | Creators are the heart of Sew Twirly. Our creator community is invite-only, ensuring a curated space of makers who are passionate about sharing their craft. If you're a creator, you can publish sewing projects, annotate your project photos with shoppable hotspots, and build a following of fans who love your work.

    div
      h2.text-xl.font-semibold.text-gray-900.mb-3 For the Community
      p.text-gray-700
        | Anyone can browse and enjoy the beautiful projects shared on Sew Twirly. Sign up to join the community — like the projects that inspire you, follow your favourite creators, and leave comments to share your appreciation and feedback. Be part of a warm, encouraging space for sewers of all levels.

    div
      h2.text-xl.font-semibold.text-gray-900.mb-3 The Hotspot Magic
      p.text-gray-700
        | Ever wonder where a creator found that perfect fabric or notions? Sew Twirly's hotspot feature lets creators annotate their project photos with product links. Click any hotspot on a project image to discover exactly what was used — and shop for it yourself. From fabric to patterns to tools, every ingredient in a project can be just a click away.

  .mt-10.pt-8.border-t
    p.text-gray-600
      | Want to join as a creator?
      '
      = link_to "Discover projects", root_path, class: "text-pink-600 hover:text-pink-800 font-medium"
      |  to see what our community is making, and reach out if you'd like to share your own work.
